      "value": "Avatar show/hide actions were moved to local storage instead of server side.\n\nThey're stored in \"%APPDATA%\\..\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\vrchat\" in the \"LocalPlayerModerations\" folder.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
